      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can you expand on that a bit? like, can you add some more specific reasoning for why the managed model is fundamentally a failure compared to the rewilding approach? i need to really drive home why it's not just an alternative, but an inferior way of doing things.",
      "source": "evaluator"
